following the control

6
00:00:18,719 --> 00:00:23,399
line of thought. Control evaluations
address fundamentally different failure

7
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:28,690
modes than other evaluations. Most safety
evaluations implicitly assume

8
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:32,570
