10
00:00:36,969 --> 00:00:41,090
Control evaluations fill this gap by
adopting the adversarial

11
00:00:41,090 --> 00:00:46,649
mindset common in CyberSecurity. Assuming
sophisticated AI agents deliberately

12
00:00:46,649 --> 00:00:51,090
trying to breach safeguards. Unlike
capability evaluations that measure

13
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:54,369
what models can do or propensity
evaluations that measure

14
00:00:54,369 --> 00:00:58,289
what models tend to do, control
evaluations measure whether

15
00:00:58,289 --> 00:01:02,210
safety protocols remain effective when
models intentionally try to

16
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:05,890
subvert them. Informally, we can
