17
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:08,489
of control by seeing that safety can be
achieved

18
00:01:08,489 --> 00:01:12,530
through two complementary paths. One
Ensuring the AI does

19
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:14,849
not try to do bad things which we wouldn't

20
00:01:14,849 --> 00:01:19,849
want alignment. 2 ensuring the AI can't
actually do

21
00:01:19,849 --> 00:01:23,909
bad things even if it tries. These are
complementary

22
00:01:23,909 --> 00:01:26,790
to each other and create two independent
