23
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:32,230
catastrophic alignment, preventing the
desire for harmful actions and

24
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:35,989
control preventing the ability to
successfully execute them. The

25
00:01:35,989 --> 00:01:40,189
control property quantifies how
effectively other safety protocols
withstand

26
00:01:40,189 --> 00:01:45,349
intentional subversion attempts by highly
capable systems. Control evaluations

27
00:01:45,349 --> 00:01:48,670
produce a probability estimate. Given that
a model is

28
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:51,200
trying its hardest to cause harm, what is
the

29
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:55,159
likelihood it succeeds? A system with
strong control properties

30
00:01:55,159 --> 00:01:59,159
has a negligible probability of causing
unacceptable outcomes despite

31
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:03,760
determined attempts to do so. This
quantitative framing allows

32
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:07,079
developers to set concrete risk thresholds
like less than

33
00:02:07,079 --> 00:02:12,039
0.1% probability of data exfiltration over
the deployment lifetime.

34
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:17,080
Control evaluations rely on conservative
assumptions about model capabilities

35
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:22,009
and knowledge. Assuming models may
understand safety measures, coordinate

36
00:02:22,009 --> 00:02:26,409
with other instances, and exploit any
available vulnerabilities, early

37
00:02:26,409 --> 00:02:30,770
detection of scheming constitutes a safety
inflection point. Catching

38
00:02:30,770 --> 00:02:34,009
models red handed in failed attempts to
subvert safety

39
00:02:34,009 --> 00:02:38,210
measures or cause harm fundamentally
changes the risk landscape.

40
00:02:38,689 --> 00:02:43,129
Rather than requiring perfect prevention
indefinitely, control measures aim

41
00:02:43,129 --> 00:02:45,610
to ensure that if the model is scheming,
it

42
00:02:45,610 --> 00:02:48,610
won't successfully cause a catastrophe
before we catch it.

43
00:02:49,689 --> 00:02:53,810
This approach transforms an impossible
problem, guaranteeing a model

44
00:02:53,810 --> 00:02:56,770
never models won't attempt attacks at all
into a

45
00:02:56,770 --> 00:03:01,370
tractable one. Ensuring dangerous behavior
is detected before causing

46
00:03:01,370 --> 00:03:05,930
irreversible harm. Catching models red
handed in failed attempts

47
00:03:06,009 --> 00:03:09,849
not only prevents immediate damage but
creates an inflection

48
00:03:09,930 --> 00:03:13,810
point. It provides concrete evidence of
misalignment that can

49
00:03:13,810 --> 00:03:19,699
trigger emergency protocols, including
deployment termination, recalls, safety
research,

50
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:24,900
redirection, and international
coordination. Once developers catch a
model

51
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:27,860
attempting to cause harm, they can study
the attempt

52
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:31,340
to strengthen countermeasures and generate
training data for detecting

53
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:34,620
similar attacks. After catching even a
single example of

54
00:03:34,620 --> 00:03:38,539
misbehavior, developers gain powerful new
tools for preventing future

55
00:03:38,539 --> 00:03:42,539
attacks. Each detected attempt provides
data that makes future

56
00:03:42,539 --> 00:03:47,919
attempts progressively less likely to
succeed. 1. Developers can

57
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:51,599
leverage a single example to generate
diverse attack variants

58
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:55,719
by modifying inputs or contexts, creating
a broader data

59
00:03:55,719 --> 00:04:01,599
set of problematic behaviors. 2.
Adversarial training training monitoring

60
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:05,400
systems on real attack examples
drastically improves their ability

61
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:09,360
to detect similar attempts as on policy
examples provide

62
00:04:09,439 --> 00:04:15,400
stronger signal than synthetic ones. 3.
Studying developers can

63
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,399
analyze which safety measures succeeded or
failed during the

64
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:21,720
attack, then strengthen the weakest points
