65
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:26,879
system. 4. Exploitation of collusion
signals if the attack

66
00:04:26,879 --> 00:04:31,279
involves coordination between AI
instances, developers can identify and

67
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:35,759
neutralize the coordination mechanisms
like specific triggers or patterns.

68
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:41,529
5. Instance specific knowledge Examining
the specific instance's attack

69
00:04:41,529 --> 00:04:45,689
strategy reveals valuable information
about its goals, capabilities, and

70
00:04:45,689 --> 00:04:49,689
limitations. There is Figure 5. Five in
