71
00:04:49,689 --> 00:04:52,730
Here it depicts basic setup for how we
might

72
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:57,410
structure control evaluations. Control
evaluations frame safety as an

73
00:04:57,410 --> 00:05:01,290
adversarial game between red and blue
teams to rigorously

74
00:05:01,290 --> 00:05:06,310
test safety protocols against intentional
subversion. Control evaluations structure

75
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:09,509
the problem as a competitive game. The Red
team

76
00:05:09,509 --> 00:05:13,110
constructs attack policies and model
substitutes that attempt to

77
00:05:13,110 --> 00:05:16,750
cause unacceptable outcomes. Serving as a
