shutdown. These advantages

112
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:24,720
allow even human red teams to construct
attack strategies

113
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:28,120
that likely upper bound what scheming
models could execute

114
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:31,560
in deployment. Blue teams need to build
multiple defensive

115
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:36,680
layers to counter sophisticated attacks
from adversarial AI. Every

116
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:39,360
control measure can be understood as a
counter move

117
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:42,600
in an adversarial game, with success
measured by how

118
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:46,120
effectively it prevents the red team from
achieving unacceptable

119
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:49,459
outcomes. And despite all the advantages
we mentioned above,

120
00:07:49,939 --> 00:07:53,819
the most effective control protocols
should integrate several defense

121
00:07:53,819 --> 00:07:58,660
categories. 1. Core monitoring systems
fast cheap monitoring runs

122
00:07:58,660 --> 00:08:03,379
on every AI action, combining trusted
monitoring, untrusted monitoring

123
00:08:03,379 --> 00:08:07,300
with collusion busting mechanisms and
activation based methods like

124
00:08:07,300 --> 00:08:11,860
coup probes to flag suspicious behavior
before execution. 2.

125
00:08:12,339 --> 00:08:17,089
Resampling and deference strategies when
monitoring FLAG's concerns, the

126
00:08:17,089 --> 00:08:20,970
system can resample outputs from the same
AI, defer

127
00:08:20,970 --> 00:08:24,689
to trusted models for safer alternatives
or escalate to

128
00:08:24,689 --> 00:08:29,089
human review, providing multiple pathways
to handle potentially dangerous

129
00:08:29,089 --> 00:08:36,210
actions without completely blocking
workflow. 3. Progressive checks of

130
00:08:36,210 --> 00:08:40,450
increasing complexity and expense examine
flagged actions before human

131
00:08:40,450 --> 00:08:45,009
involvement using techniques like
incrimination testing how the AI

132
00:08:45,009 --> 00:08:49,850
responds to modified inputs to reveal
