133
00:08:49,929 --> 00:08:54,730
Human review processes Specially trained
auditors examine actions flagged

134
00:08:54,730 --> 00:08:58,730
as highly suspicious with different
processes for concentrated risks

135
00:08:58,889 --> 00:09:03,850
requiring immediate blocking versus
