228
00:15:23,399 --> 00:15:28,600
Control evaluations face limitations as AI
capabilities increase dramatically.

229
00:15:29,299 --> 00:15:32,419
The methodology depends on Red Team's
ability to elicit

230
00:15:32,419 --> 00:15:35,940
capabilities comparable to what scheming
models might deploy in

231
